* MQ objects for the ACE pub/sub demo. Apply with:
*   runmqsc <QMGR> < mq-objects.mqsc
*
* Publishing and subscribing in ACE are done with MQ OBJECTS, not node
* properties: MQOutput has no topic attribute, MQInput has no subscription
* attribute, and the Publication node takes its topic from the message.

DEFINE TOPIC(ACE.DEMO.TOPIC) TOPICSTR('ace/demo/orders') REPLACE

* destination for the subscription; MQ_SUB_MF reads this queue
DEFINE QLOCAL(ACE.PUBSUB.SUBQ) REPLACE

* where the subscriber flow puts what it received
DEFINE QLOCAL(ACE.PUBSUB.OUT) REPLACE

* lets MQOutput publish: an alias queue whose target is the TOPIC object
DEFINE QALIAS(ACE.DEMO.PUB.ALIAS) TARGTYPE(TOPIC) TARGET(ACE.DEMO.TOPIC) REPLACE

* administrative subscription. NOTE: admin subscriptions are DURABLE by
* definition - publications accumulate on the destination queue while the
* subscriber flow is stopped. A non-durable subscription can only be created by
* an application at runtime, which no built-in ACE node does.
DEFINE SUB(ACE.DEMO.SUB) TOPICOBJ(ACE.DEMO.TOPIC) DEST(ACE.PUBSUB.SUBQ) REPLACE
